he public holiday. Public (Bank holiday, banks and offices are closed), Bank (Bank holiday, banks and offices are closed), School (School holiday, schools are closed), Authorities (Authorities are closed), Optional (Majority of people take a day off), Observance (Optional festivity, no paid day off)\",\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"Public\",\"Bank\",\"School\",\"Authorities\",\"Optional\",\"Observance\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"}}},\"description\":\"Successful response with list of public holidays\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid year or country code format\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Country not found or no holidays available for the specified year\"}},\"securitySource\":\"unspecified\"}"
